下面这段消费者代码在生产环境频繁触发 rebalance，日志里能看到
`Member ... has left the group` 与 `This member will leave the group because consumer poll timeout has expired`。

```java
props.put(ConsumerConfig.ENABLE_AUTO_COMMIT_CONFIG, "false");
props.put(ConsumerConfig.MAX_POLL_RECORDS_CONFIG, "2000");
props.put(ConsumerConfig.SESSION_TIMEOUT_MS_CONFIG, "10000");
props.put(ConsumerConfig.HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_MS_CONFIG, "5000");
// 每条消息的处理平均耗时 300ms

while (true) {
    ConsumerRecords<String, String> rs = consumer.poll(Duration.ofMillis(500));
    for (ConsumerRecord<String, String> r : rs) {
        process(r);              // 平均 300ms
    }
    consumer.commitSync();
}
```

请指出**至少两处**配置问题并给出修正值。
